From: mergimg0 <256672396+mergimg0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:40:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] feat(core): hook contracts for in-host harness adapter

- run-sensors: AIDLC_SENSOR_FEEDBACK=1 prints the dispatcher's verdicts as
  one {"sensor_feedback":[...]} stdout line so an in-host adapter can show
  sensor results to the model; default output is unchanged.
- continue-workflow: recognise Coding Harness session transcripts (session
  header line) for the conversational-stop carve-out and the turn-end usage
  fold.
- usage: read harness sessions (usage.{input,output,cacheRead,cacheWrite},
  responseId grouping, reported cost when the rate table has no row) plus
  nested subagent/advisor transcripts, attributed from the parent's task
  calls.
- includes: repoint .harness-aidlc/host/includes.json and persona method
  paths on a space switch.
- runner-gen restart guidance and the learnings distribution guard know the
  harness tree.
